---
import AcademicLayout from "../../layouts/AcademicLayout.astro";
---

<AcademicLayout title="About" currentSection="about">
  <div class="container container-prose page-wrapper">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">About Symnoesis</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        An open research initiative for the transparent measurement and governance of human–machine interaction.
      </p>
    </header>

    <article class="prose-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Initiative Origin</h2>
        <p>
          Symnoesis (SYMN-01) is an independent, not-for-profit open research initiative established by <strong>HarVa Groups</strong>.
          It was founded to address a critical structural gap in artificial intelligence evaluation: models are universally scored in single-turn isolation, 
          ignoring the complex cognitive adaptations, skill deskilling, and autonomy surrender that occur when humans work with systems over weeks and months.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Organizational Facts & Transparency</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with our binding evidence and claims policy, we publish only verified organizational facts:
        </p>
        <div class="facts-card">
          <table class="facts-table">
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Initiative Sponsor</th>
                <td>HarVa Groups (Verified)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Specification Version</th>
                <td>SYMN-01 v0.1.0 (Draft)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Code License</th>
                <td>Apache License 2.0</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Specification License</th>
                <td>Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">External Funding</th>
                <td>None (Self-funded open science initiative)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Repository</th>
                <td><a href="https://github.com/harvagroups/symnoesis" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/harvagroups/symnoesis</a></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Scientific Restraint & Honesty</h2>
        <p>
          We do not claim that Symnoesis is a "revolutionary breakthrough" or an "industry-standard solution". 
          It is a carefully engineered, falsifiable, and mathematically rigorous research specification. 
          We invite researchers, psychologists, systems engineers, and policy analysts to test the implementation, 
          reproduce the worked vectors, and critique the model.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</AcademicLayout>

<style>
  .page-wrapper {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .prose-content {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .prose-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .facts-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .facts-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .facts-table th, .facts-table td {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .facts-table th {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    width: 35%;
  }

  .facts-table td {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
